38
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,200
But you don't need to worry.

39
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,960
Dealing with the dead,

40
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,880
to me,

41
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:55,680
is just an everyday routine.

42
00:04:56,760 --> 00:05:01,640
If the King of Hell approves the paperwork,

43
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:04,800
