44
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:10,360
In a flash, I've done this for decades.

45
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:13,560
I've sent off so many people.

46
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:21,960
This time,

47
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,400
