It's not that I'm afraid.

57
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:23,680
I just

58
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:27,080
didn't get enough time with my kids.

59
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,800
Just thinking that

60
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:44,400
