63
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,680
All my life,

64
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:07,040
I haven't left the kids anything.

65
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:14,680
Let me leave them something to remember.

66
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,440
You're still laughing?

67
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,120
Okay, okay, okay.

68
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,960
You're right.

69
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:56,680
Smile.

70
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:02,880
Smiling is better than crying.

71
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,040
I'll remember that.

72
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:10,680
Smiling... is better than crying.

73
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,720
I'll remember that.

74
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:33,120
Assembly at the altar,

75
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:38,040
