95
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,200
You heartless brat.

96
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:43,400
But you never care about your old man.

97
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,960
Do I not care about you?

98
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,400
