106
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,200
I mind when it's the people I care about.

107
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:49,960
Based on the patient's current condition,

108
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:53,880
although she isn't terminal yet,

109
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:59,560
but some of her organs have shut down.

110
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:03,600
It's normal for her not to eat or drink.

111
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,320
So at a time like this,

112
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:09,040
