119
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:39,320
Got it?

120
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:52,360
That's unnecessary.

121
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:56,000
The patient is dehydrated right now,

122
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:59,360
