123
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:04,000
We can't cover her with anything heavy.

124
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:08,000
The patient is extremely fragile now.

125
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,360
Even the slightest bit of weight

126
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:13,920
