129
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,120
I got it.

130
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:26,400
Who'll remind you when I'm gone?

131
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:28,240
Quick, knock on wood!

132
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,280
Pour some warm water.

133
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:40,600
Dementia can cause a lot of complications.

134
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:41,960
At this stage,

135
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:44,520
