136
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:47,240
and their whole body is in agony.

137
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,600
So we need to

138
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:53,160
gently rotate her arms for her.

139
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:56,400
Remember, follow the meridians.

140
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:58,680
The arms.

141
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:03,600
We can also help wipe her forehead,

142
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,760
