146
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,120
Just give it a try.

147
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,160
Grandma.

148
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,160
The jasmine you grew

149
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:56,960
