150
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,920
I brought you the most fragrant pot.

151
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,360
This way,

152
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,400
you can smell it

153
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:04,880
and feel like

154
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,040
you're home.

155
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,760
Soul

156
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:09,200
Soul

157
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,480
Social

158
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,320
Social

159
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,080
Social

160
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:19,320
Social

161
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:21,480
Social

162
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,120
Social

163
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,400
What are you looking at?

164
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,960
Why so nervous?

165
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,400
I do funeral services,

166
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,680
and you do wedding planning.

167
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,320
It's not like I'm gonna steal your ideas.

168
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,600
I'm just afraid a Top-tier grad like you

169
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:40,400
