170
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,720
You're making fast progress.

171
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:46,080
You even make presentations on a PC now.

172
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,400
To be honest,

173
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,760
