174
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:52,600
I think there's still hope for me.

175
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:54,680
The problem is this brain is failing me.

176
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,040
I thought about it over and over,

177
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:57,800
