180
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,000
Business model.

181
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:03,600
Right, right.

182
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:04,800
That business model.

183
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,560
I think our Xi Dong Dong is really

184
