190
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:20,880
Aren't Zhou Fang and Xu Wumei there?

191
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:23,120
Those two idiots?

192
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:27,160
No ideas, no plans, no creativity.

193
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:28,760
They do things randomly,

194
00:18:28,760 --> 00:18:30,640
