195
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,400
Just groping blindly.

196
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,320
Not bad, Wu Huilan.

197
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:35,920
You even have strategic thinking now.

198
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,120
What?

199
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,040
Strategic thinking?

200
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:42,200
What the heck is strategic thinking?

201
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,720
Simply put, strategic thinking

202
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:46,600
