204
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,640
Then you stand tall and look far.

205
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,760
How tall? And how far?

206
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,280
Explain it to me specifically.

207
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,920
Based on user needs,

208
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,240
you take the high ground

209
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,480
and begin with the end in mind.

210
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,600
It's so competitive now,

211
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:03,560
