215
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,280
Tell me in detail.

216
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:13,400
What exactly are user needs?

217
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:15,800
User needs mean

218
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:19,680
