219
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,680
You provide exactly what they want.

220
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,640
You categorize them.

221
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,280
What does "take the high ground" mean?

222
00:19:26,520 --> 00:19:27,720
High ground, high ground.

223
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:29,160
You choose a high place,

224
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,320
and look down from above.

225
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:31,520
Have a big picture view.

226
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:37,400
So "begin with the end in mind"...

227
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,560
