231
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:44,880
Right.

232
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:45,600
That's exactly what it means.

233
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:47,080
Your...

234
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,440
