238
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,800
If I were dumb,

239
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,800
how could I have such a smart daughter?

240
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:56,640
Alright, alright.

241
00:19:57,280 --> 00:19:58,440
The faintest ink is better than the best memory.

242
00:19:58,440 --> 00:19:59,160
Write it down.

243
00:19:59,160 --> 00:19:59,640
Okay.

244
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:03,200
What thinking?

245
00:20:03,320 --> 00:20:04,360
Strategic thinking.

246
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:05,360
Strategic thinking.

247
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,320
Do you know how to write it?

248
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:07,040
"Stra-"

249
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:07,960
Is this how you spell "stra"?

250
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:08,640
Right.

251
00:20:09,120 --> 00:20:09,760
"-tegic."

252
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:11,080
"-tegic." T-E...

253
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:12,640
G-I-C?

254
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,240
Right.

255
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,240
Yes, G-I-C.

256
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:15,480
"Think-"

257
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:17,560
"-ing."

258
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:41,600
Great.

259
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:43,440
Beautiful, truly beautiful.

260
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:45,880
Shiqi's playing

261
00:20:46,520 --> 00:20:47,640
