272
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,120
Lao Fan,

273
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:10,000
you raised a star of a daughter.

274
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,400
Not at all.

275
00:21:12,600 --> 00:21:13,400
Director Wang,

276
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:14,680
about what happened last time,

277
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:17,520
I still need to apologize to you.

278
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:21,960
It's good that young people have character.

279
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:26,840
Come, let me refill your glass.

280
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:28,600
Uncle Fan,

281
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:30,240
about what happened last time,

282
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:31,840
I was also at fault.

283
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,840
Shiqi told me

284
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:33,720
