285
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:38,000
Easygoing girls like her are rare now.

286
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:40,120
Listen to him.

287
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:42,120
Our Xiao Wang is so sensible.

288
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:44,880
Come on,

289
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:46,000
